{title: Open Sky}
{artist: Freevia Demo}
{composer: Freevia Demo}
{lyricist: Freevia Demo}
{key: D}
{tempo: 126}
{time: 4/4}
{comment: Original demonstration lyrics and illustrative chord chart created for Freevia; no recording or synced timing supplied.}

{start_of_intro}
[D] [A] [Bm] [G]
{end_of_intro}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[D]Pack the cables, [A]check the lights,
[Bm]Roll the cases [G]through the night.
[D]Empty stage and [A]open door,
[G]Hear our footsteps [A]on the floor.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_pre_chorus}
[Em]Count us in and [G]take a breath,
[D]There is nothing [A]hidden left.
{end_of_pre_chorus}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Raise your voice to the [A]open sky,
[Bm]Let the little sparks go [G]flying by.
[D]Every rhythm has a [A]place to start,
[G]Every room can hold a [A]beating [D]heart.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[D]Hands are clapping [A]at the back,
[Bm]Keep the chorus [G]on the track.
[D]When a string slips [A]out of tune,
[G]We will find the [A]melody soon.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Raise your voice to the [A]open sky,
[Bm]Let the little sparks go [G]flying by.
[D]Every rhythm has a [A]place to start,
[G]Every room can hold a [A]beating [D]heart.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[Bm]Turn it down and [G]listen close,
[D]Hear the voice that [A]needs us most.
[Em]One by one we [G]join the line,
[A]Your song fits beside mine.
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Raise your voice to the [A]open sky,
[Bm]Let the little sparks go [G]flying by.
[D]Every rhythm has a [A]place to start,
[G]Every room can hold a [A]beating [D]heart.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_outro}
[G]Leave the light on, [A]say good[D]night.
[G]We will sing a[A]gain in [D]time.
{end_of_outro}
